{"name":"Lion","hex":"#c19a62","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Lion","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["The constellation and zodiacal sign Leo."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A player for National Football League's Detroit Lions.","A player for Canadian Football League's B.C. Lions."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Lion"}],"entries":[{"title":"Lion","blocks":[{"text":"The lion is a large cat of the genus Panthera, currently ranging only in Sub-Saharan Africa and India. It has a muscular, broad-chested body; a short, rounded head; round ears; and a dark, hairy tuft at the tip of its tail. It is sexually dimorphic; adult male lions are larger than females and have a prominent mane that extends from the head to the shoulders and chest."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/020_The_lion_king_Snyggve_in_the_Serengeti_National_Park_Photo_by_Giles_Laurent.jpg/330px-020_The_lion_king_Snyggve_in_the_Serengeti_National_Park_Photo_by_Giles_Laurent.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lion","wikidata":"Q140"},{"title":"Lion (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Lion is a color that is a representation of the average color of the fur of a lion."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/020_The_lion_king_Snyggve_in_the_Serengeti_National_Park_Photo_by_Giles_Laurent.jpg/330px-020_The_lion_king_Snyggve_in_the_Serengeti_National_Park_Photo_by_Giles_Laurent.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lion_(color)","wikidata":"Q6555379"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Okonjima_Lioness.jpg/500px-Okonjima_Lioness.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Okonjima_Lioness.jpg/1280px-Okonjima_Lioness.jpg